  %[control:button:141e]{"position":[1,2]}
xSoln1
IsEqualCheck(xSoln1,Cinv*d);
%%
%[text] ![](text:image:0171) **Task 6.** Compute the solution to $\\mathbf{Cx} = \\mathbf{d}${"altText":"Cx=d"} using the [backslash operator](https://www.mathworks.com/help/matlab/ref/double.mldivide.html) ().
