  %[control:button:3555]{"position":[1,2]}
xSoln2
IsEqualCheck(xSoln2,C\d);
%%
%[text] ![](text:image:1ec1) **Task 7.** Is the solution computed using the inverse the same as the solution computed using the backslash operator? To find out, try taking the differences of the two solutions: `xSoln1` and `xSoln2`.
